OL,5,Aforgotten
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis was 22 March 2017, when attacker
OL,8,FKhalid Masood drove his car into
OL,9,Fcrowds, killing four, before stabbing a
OL,10,Fpolice officer to death outside
OL,11,FParliament.
